{
    "appliance_id": "ffa79bec-d4fd-5842-89b4-e08f8fe21bf9",
    "name": "SRLinux",
    "category": "router",
    "description": "Nokia SR Linux is the open, modular, and deeply programmable network operating system running on Nokia data center routers. It exposes a full TUI CLI, a gNMI/json-rpc management plane, and supports BGP, OSPF, IS-IS, MPLS, EVPN, segment routing and more.\n\nThis Docker image runs SR Linux unmodified inside a GNS3 Docker node. The Web console opens directly in the native sr_cli TUI (via the docker_exec console).",
    "vendor_name": "Nokia",
    "vendor_url": "https://www.nokia.com/ip-networks/service-router-linux-NOS/",
    "documentation_url": "https://documentation.nokia.com/srlinux/",
    "product_name": "SR Linux",
    "product_url": "https://www.nokia.com/ip-networks/service-router-linux-NOS/",
    "registry_version": 8,
    "status": "experimental",
    "availability": "free",
    "maintainer": "GNS3 Team",
    "maintainer_email": "developers@gns3.net",
    "usage": "The Web console opens directly in the SR Linux CLI (`sr_cli`).\n\nData interfaces default to `admin-state disable`; enable them before use:\n\n```\nenter candidate\ninterface ethernet-1/1\n  admin-state enable\ncommit now\n```\n\nTo make a data interface carry traffic, also bind it to a network-instance (default VRF `default`). The first port (mgmt0) is the management interface.\n\nSave the running config with `save config` (persisted across node stop/start via `/etc/opt/srlinux`).\n\nThe CLI auto-logs out after 300s idle; just reopen the console, or disable it:\n\n```\nenter candidate\n/system cli idle-timeout disable\ncommit now\n```",
    "netmiko_device_type": "nokia_sros_telnet",
    "symbol": ":/symbols/affinity/circle/blue/router_cloud.svg",
    "settings": [
        {
            "name": "Default template settings",
            "default": true,
            "template_type": "docker",
            "template_properties": {
                "adapters": 35,
                "image": "ghcr.io/nokia/srlinux:latest",
                "console_type": "docker_exec",
                "start_command": "sudo -E bash -c 'touch /.dockerenv && /opt/srlinux/bin/sr_linux'",
                "environment": "GNS3_SKIP_INIT=1\nGNS3_INTERFACE_NAMES=mgmt0,e1-1,e1-2,e1-3,e1-4,e1-5,e1-6,e1-7,e1-8,e1-9,e1-10,e1-11,e1-12,e1-13,e1-14,e1-15,e1-16,e1-17,e1-18,e1-19,e1-20,e1-21,e1-22,e1-23,e1-24,e1-25,e1-26,e1-27,e1-28,e1-29,e1-30,e1-31,e1-32,e1-33,e1-34\nGNS3_CONSOLE_CMD=/opt/srlinux/bin/sr_cli",
                "extra_volumes": [
                    "/etc/opt/srlinux",
                    "/var/log/srlinux",
                    "/opt/srlinux/appmgr"
                ],
                "custom_adapters": [
                    {
                        "adapter_number": 0,
                        "port_name": "mgmt0"
                    },
                    {
                        "adapter_number": 1,
                        "port_name": "e1-1"
                    },
